"value":2,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5213300","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4554030-1847286114044076","game_id":"steam-4554030","kind":"announcement","title":"Happy Ace Week!","summary":"Happy Ace Week! I’m excited to share that Ace & Aro: Heart-to-Heart is taking part in the first ever Steam event celebrating games with asexual themes and / or made by ace developers! Games such as Our Wonderland , I Just Want To Be Single!! and In Stars And Time – plus many others – are taking part! There are free games, demos and many on sale, like my previous game, VIDEOVERSE , which is 55% off during the festival – its biggest discount yet! Check out the full festival here: Game That Ace It ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-26T08:29:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114044076","verified_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4554030-1846651706691575","game_id":"steam-4554030","kind":"announcement","title":"Watch the developer stream of Ace & Aro: One Night Early","summary":"As you may have already seen, the demo of Ace & Aro: Heart-to-Heart – Ace & Aro: One Night Early – is available to play during Steam Next Fest! It takes place one night before the events of the full game, introducing players to Maya – the host of the Ace & Aro meetup, and Barcade Bros – the snazzy, underground barcade.You can also watch me (the developer), play the demo during a pre-recorded stream. This will be on loop during the whole festival, so no matter where or when you are in the world, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:07:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691575","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4554030-1846018067928804","game_id":"steam-4554030","kind":"announcement","title":"Ace & Aro: One Night Early – Out now!","summary":"Hello all,The demo of Ace & Aro: Heart-to-Heart – 'Ace & Aro: One Night Early' – is now available to play on Steam! It takes place one night before the events of the full game, introducing players to Maya – the host of the Ace & Aro meetup, and Barcade Bros – the snazzy, underground barcade!The demo takes around 20 minutes to play, so there is plenty of time to check it out ahead of the full game’s release! Get to know Maya, take a tour around the bar, try a cocktail and dance to one of the song","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T08:26:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067928804","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4554030-1843481262692280","game_id":"steam-4554030","kind":"announcement","title":"Final artwork and screenshots have appeared!","summary":"Hello everyone,Some new screenshots and promotional artwork have appeared on the store page! Things are now looking much more complete as Ace & Aro: Heart-to-Heart nears the end of its development!Many of the new screenshots reflect the final UI and artwork, though there are some exciting additions... The Barman who owns Barcade Bros (and has a very strong Scottish accent!): The mini-game, Pixel Pieces, which you can play with Theo:The game's CGs, for those more intimate moments:And, in case you","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T13:48:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262692280","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4554030-1842212951310632","game_id":"steam-4554030","kind":"announcement","title":"New teaser trailer!","summary":"Hello,I'm excited to share with you all the brand new teaser trailer for Ace & Aro: Heart-to-Heart! Please watch below:Now on the Steam store page too!In the trailer, we're introduced to the meetup space (Barcade Bros) by Maya. We then see glimpses of the rhythm game Boogie Beat Revolution, the puzzle game Pixel Pieces, a few character conversations and a couple of CGs. Creating all the artwork for Ace & Aro has been a lot of fun and, as with all my games, no generative AI has been used at all!I","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T15:44:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951310632","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4554030-1833968530899881","game_id":"steam-4554030","kind":"announcement","title":"New Screenshots of Ace & Aro: Heart-to-Heart","summary":"Hello everyone,New screenshots have appeared on the store page! As Ace & Aro: Heart-to-Heart is still in development, artwork and UI are currently being finalised, so these screenshots reflect the most recent updates. You may also notice two brand new screenshots: words of encouragement from Maya and a CG of Pedro hugging Aisha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-02T09:36:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530899881","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4554030-1828894815565121","game_id":"steam-4554030","kind":"announcement","title":"Announcing Kinmoku's Next Game: 'Ace & Aro: Heart-to-Heart'","summary":"🖤🩶 Today is International Asexuality Day! 🤍💜To celebrate, I'm happy to share my next game Ace & Aro: Heart-to-Heart which invites you to talk freely with a-spec characters, understand their journeys and make lasting connections. This short, insightful narrative experience will be coming soon to Steam for PC, Mac, Linux and Steam Deck!Ace & Aro: Heart-to-Heart welcomes you into an Ace and Aro meetup, which just so happens to be located in a barcade! So there are a few mini-games and VIDEOVERSE re","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-06T12:28:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815565121","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4554030":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:46Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:45Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4554030":"2026-10-26T12:52:46Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4554030":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:45Z"},"5213300":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:46Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:46Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:46Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4554030","app_id":4554030,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:40Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"98cd17e98b51f586d01ea7c1e26e73c2f3d6266a4dab385febf9d364e6e0de07","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Welcome to the Ace & Aro Meetup! Whether you’re a-spec yourself or just curious to learn more, we hope you feel welcome here. Meet the members, try a cocktail (o